/** Throws the failure at path, behind the name of what is read: `$`-rooted for a types-mode decoder (`Skill: $.events[1].level`), from the file's top for a data file (`skills.json: rows[1].level`) (CODEGEN.md §5.13, DECISIONS 361). */
function decFail(path: string, message: string): never {
